#: ../../source/docs/common-servo-robotis.rst:26
#: bbbdcaaba4144fec9c8cac3a691b2995
msgid "Configuring the Servos"
msgstr "舵机配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-servo-robotis.rst:28
#: 3f24d29b01d64620a665d366680b176a
msgid ""
"Before initial use the ID for each servo needs to be set using the DYNAMIXEL"
" Wizard configuration tool."
msgstr "首次使用前，需要使用DYNAMIXEL Wizard配置工具为每个舵机设置ID。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-servo-robotis.rst:30
#: 5add8fce287548aead10a7575dd8a06b
msgid ""
"`DYNAMIXEL Wizard 2.0 "
"<http://emanual.robotis.com/docs/en/software/dynamixel/dynamixel_wizard2/>`__"
" is the latest DYNAMIXEL configuration tool supporting Windows / Linux / Mac"
" OSX."
msgstr ""
"`DYNAMIXEL Wizard 2.0 "
"<http://emanual.robotis.com/docs/en/software/dynamixel/dynamixel_wizard2/>`__"
" 是最新的DYNAMIXEL配置工具，支持Windows/Linux/Mac OSX。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-servo-robotis.rst:32
#: 474d6b48c5e84fd3a165be3731a3e639
msgid ""
"Visit `ROBOTIS' international download center "
"<https://en.robotis.com/service/downloadpage.php?ca_id=10>`__ to download "
"and install DYNAMIXEL Wizard 2.0\""
msgstr ""
"访问 `ROBOTIS国际下载中心 "
"<https://en.robotis.com/service/downloadpage.php?ca_id=10>`__ 下载并安装DYNAMIXEL"
" Wizard 2.0。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-servo-robotis.rst:33
#: 67fab8ace8a0489a96e4935498a9fdb5
msgid ""
"Attach the U2D2 to the servos as described in the `online manual "
"<http://emanual.robotis.com/docs/en/parts/interface/u2d2/>`__"
msgstr ""
"按照 `在线手册 <http://emanual.robotis.com/docs/en/parts/interface/u2d2/>`__ "
"中的说明将U2D2连接到舵机。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-servo-robotis.rst:34
#: 9f52334e581b4a12a57f0d0c384355fd
msgid ""
"Start the R+ Manager, connect to the appropriate COM port and set each "
"servo's ID to a value from 1 to 16.  The number chosen for each servo should"
" correspond to the servo number used to configure and control the servo.  "
"For example if the ID is set to \"9\", the :ref:`SERVO9_MIN <SERVO9_MIN>`, "
":ref:`SERVO9_MAX <SERVO9_MAX>`, :ref:`SERVO9_FUNCTION <SERVO9_FUNCTION>`, "
"etc parameters will be used to configure the servo."
msgstr ""
"启动R+ "
"Manager，连接到相应的COM端口，将每个舵机的ID设置为1到16之间的数值。为每个舵机选择的数字应对应用于配置和控制该舵机的舵机编号。例如，如果ID设置为「9」，则使用"
" :ref:`SERVO9_MIN <SERVO9_MIN>`、:ref:`SERVO9_MAX "
"<SERVO9_MAX>`、:ref:`SERVO9_FUNCTION <SERVO9_FUNCTION>` 等参数来配置该舵机。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-servo-robotis.rst:37
#: ba015bd3519a464eaec89247ff917539
msgid "Connecting and Configuring"
msgstr "连接和配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-servo-robotis.rst:42
#: b89823f49d5a4c3bb94ae6a8e7e37414
msgid ""
"Connect one of the servos to any serial port on the autopilot.  In this "
"example SERIAL4 is used but any serial port should work"
msgstr "将其中一个舵机连接到飞控上的任意串行端口。此示例使用SERIAL4，但任何串行端口均可使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-servo-robotis.rst:43
#: 80578628bd8d49e2bc7eb441f41a39a3
msgid ""
"Additional servos should be connected to the first by daisy chaining them as"
" shown above"
msgstr "其他舵机应如上图所示以菊花链方式连接到第一个舵机。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-servo-robotis.rst:44
#: 35464bf14785498cb5de4ca6c1b18b23
msgid "Set the following parameters on the autopilot"
msgstr "在飞控上设置以下参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-servo-robotis.rst:46
#: ac0911c6358b43edb3e0da8a4f572c1b
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL <SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` = 19 (\"RobotisServo\")"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL <SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` = 19（「RobotisServo」）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-servo-robotis.rst:47
#: 3e46c5f837b243a8a3bc0330768b6e51
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL4_BAUD <SERIAL4_BAUD>` = 57 (57600 baud)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL4_BAUD <SERIAL4_BAUD>` = 57（57600波特）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-servo-robotis.rst:48
#: 940b7defc279490996e0b3e05067d323
msgid ""
":ref:`SERIAL4_OPTIONS <SERIAL4_OPTIONS>` = 4 to enable half-duplex mode"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL4_OPTIONS <SERIAL4_OPTIONS>` = 4 以启用半双工模式"

#: ../../source/docs/common-servo-robotis.rst:51
#: dc17651f615143208e919e382e36f6ab
msgid "Testing with the Mission Planner"
msgstr "使用Mission Planner测试"

#: ../../source/docs/common-servo-robotis.rst:53
#: 360f4f2747894c0695ff15fc64e8b9b6
msgid ""
"The mission planner's Flight Data screen includes a \"Servo\" tab on the "
"bottom right that can be used to test that the servos are moving correctly."
msgstr "Mission Planner的飞行数据界面右下角包含一个「Servo」（舵机）标签，可用于测试舵机是否正确运动。"
